=3 Notes
* Count Dracula is a Dark Knight. While he hits really hard he only moves at regular speed and has horrible pathing, if you get in trouble kiting is incredibly easy. He also stops frequently to cast tier 2 nukes and absorb spells.
* TP moves are as follows

:* Bloodrake: Single target drain attack. Multiple hits and absorbable by 3 shadows. Does around 1000-1500 damage on a WAR/NIN without full shadows up.
:* Decollation: Medium physical conal damage.
:* Eternal Damnation: Line attack Doom, gaze attack, removable with {s:Cursna}. Also removable with {i:Holy Water|Holy Water|4154}.
:* Heliovoid: AoE Status drain, drains 1 effect, including food, from everybody within range. Note that if he absorbs counterstance his counters will not show in the chat log.
:* Nocturnal Servitude: Conal Charm, turns those affected into bats. Seems to last around a minute.
:* Nosferatu's Kiss: AoE HP and TP drain. After using this weapon skill a {m:Cursed Doppelganger} will be summoned, copying the target of Nosferatu's Kiss. The Doppelganger will look like the target including weapons/armour. The weapons of the target and its job traits will be shared by the Doppelganger. The Doppelganger will use weaponskills based upon the weapons of the target, including relic WS if relevant.
:* Wings of Gehenna: AoE damage, knockback and stun. Wipes shadows.

